<title>USA: Dura sees continued product acquisition.</title>
<headline>Dura sees continued product acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dura Pharmaceuticals Inc Chief Executive Cam Garner said he expects the company's strong growth to continue both through continued product acquisition and the emergence of its innovative dry powder inhaler drug delivery system.</p>
<p>Speaking at the Robertson Stephens &amp; Co-sponsored 1996 medical conference in New York, Garner said the company has about $200 million in cash earmarked for the acquisition of products in the future.</p>
</text>
